OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785273536
OL,3,CUefa hits out at Fifa plan for private
OL,4,Cinvestors to run World Cup
OL,6,FUefa has insisted the World Cup is not
OL,7,Fan "asset to trade" after Fifa
OL,8,Fconfirmed plans to set up a private
OL,9,Fcompany to run its competitions.
OL,11,FFifa President Gianni Infantino is
OL,12,Fseeking to create a $20bn (about
OL,13,F#14.93 bn) company which will run the
OL,14,Fglobal tournament with private
OL,15,Finvestors, including the Kushner
OL,16,Ffamily, who have links to US President
OL,17,FDonald Trump.
OL,26,@oD@DOUoD@SO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/9
