OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785273536
OL,3,CUefa hits out at Fifa plan for private
OL,4,Cinvestors to run World Cup
OL,6,FThe company, named Fifa Forward
OL,7,FEnterprise (FFE), would lead to a
OL,8,Fsignificant increase in football
OL,9,Fdevelopment funding to national
OL,10,Fassociations and bring the total
OL,11,Fspending on development to more than
OL,12,F#10bn (#7.5bn) in the next four years,
OL,13,FFifa has claimed.
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/9
