FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785273536
OL,3,CUefa hits out at Fifa plan for private
OL,4,Cinvestors to run World Cup
OL,6,FThrive Eternal, a company launched in
OL,7,FApril by Joshua Kushner, the brother
OL,8,Fof Trump's son-in-law Jared Kushner,
OL,9,Fwould lead the proposed investor group
OL,10,Ffor FFE if the proposal is given the
OL,11,Fgreen light.
OL,13,FThe Union of European Football
OL,14,FAssociations (Uefa) criticised the
OL,15,Fplan in a strongly worded statement.
OL,17,F"This crosses a line that football's
OL,18,Fgoverning institutions should never
OL,19,Fcross," it said.
OL,26,@yD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785273536
OL,3,CUefa hits out at Fifa plan for private
OL,4,Cinvestors to run World Cup
OL,6,F"Uefa takes it extremely seriously. So
OL,7,Fshould every national football
OL,8,Fassociation. So should every
OL,9,Fstakeholder: leagues, clubs, players,
OL,10,Fsupporters, governments and everyone
OL,11,Fwho cares about the future of the game.
OL,13,F"The soul and governance of football
OL,14,Fare not assets to trade ` especially
OL,15,Fwith zero transparency as to who gains
OL,16,Ffinancially. None of us are the owners
OL,17,Fof football. It is not Fifa's to sell."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
