CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785273536
OL,3,CUefa hits out at Fifa plan for private
OL,4,Cinvestors to run World Cup
OL,6,FThe Times reported that Infantino, who
OL,7,Fis seeking re-election as Fifa
OL,8,Fpresident next year on a four-year
OL,9,Fterm, could become the commissioner or
OL,10,Fchief executive of the new vehicle
OL,11,Ffrom 2031.
OL,13,FFifa's statement did not provide any
OL,14,Finformation on any role for Infantino
OL,15,Fwithin FFE, other than to say it would
OL,16,Fbe owned and controlled by the body.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
