CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785273536
OL,3,CUefa hits out at Fifa plan for private
OL,4,Cinvestors to run World Cup
OL,6,FThe vast majority of Fifa's revenue is
OL,7,Fgenerated from the men's World Cup,
OL,8,Fwhich is believed to have generated
OL,9,Faround $15bn (#11bn) in income this
OL,10,Fyear, according to The Guardian.
OL,12,FFifa also said JP Morgan had been
OL,13,Fengaged to work alongside it regarding
OL,14,Fthe FFE proposal.
OL,16,FIt would retain "exclusive authority"
OL,17,Fover football governance,
OL,18,Fcompetitions, match calendar, and all
OL,19,Fregulatory and sporting decisions, it
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,26,@xD@QOUxD@eO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/9
