OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785273536
OL,3,CUefa hits out at Fifa plan for private
OL,4,Cinvestors to run World Cup
OL,6,FThe press release on the proposal
OL,7,Fconcluded: "Outside investors will
OL,8,Fhave only a minority stake in FFE and
OL,9,Fwill not play any operational role.
OL,11,F"Equally, they are investing in a
OL,12,Fsubsidiary of Fifa, and not in Fifa
OL,13,Fitself. For Fifa, nothing changes."
OL,15,FUefa's statement follows on from its
OL,16,Fpresident Aleksander Ceferin opting
OL,17,Fnot to attend the World Cup final in
OL,18,Fprotest at a series of governance
OL,19,Fdecisions and actions by Fifa he had
OL,20,Fnot agreed with.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
